  "observations": [
    "20 close views cover idle and all four gait phases in four directions. Double buns, full beard in front views, bare torso, brown sash, grey trousers and sandals retain this chapter identity. Both hands meet the handles; no scholar headcloth, star crown, robe or magic is introduced.",
    "Four actual movement images show the actor with its cart. Pushcart name and HP labels clear the selected silhouette; wheel position is stable by numeric checks. The 20 default-camera poses and four 1.6 passing-B views show no obvious opaque rectangle or adjacent-quadrant bleed at the sampled filters.",
    "Eight hurt/attack images use the original Gongsun body beside the independent parked cart. Original hurt/attack labels and floating damage remain close to hair/weapon; nearby enemy labels can overlap. This is not full interruption/UI polish.",
    "Original pickup/delivery/drop and four unloaded locale images retain the correct portrait and restore the original body after delivery. Pickup/drop has crowded actors, labels and old escort shoulder art; this is not a clean whole-scene composition.",
    "Default SE screenshots retain transient 19 damage text near the name. Cloth, ropes, wood colour, pose silhouette and some perceived body size vary by source frame; full spoke rotation and smoother transitions remain art polish.",
    "Three-load progress, shoulder-carry wording and mixed untranslated goods/messages remain visible. This batch does not establish seven carts carrying eleven burdens, full localization, natural full wine-plot gameplay, performance, campaign/save, Steam or all-art completion."
  ]
